  "$comment": "Docs synced read-only from the product repos (git show <ref>:<path>). Owner decision Q8: main until launch, release tags after. `dir` syncs every .md in it except `exclude` (internal docs), plus `extra` repo-root files (SECURITY.md, synced as /docs/security; owner decision O3); `order` sets the docs navigation. Run `npm run sync:docs`, review, commit.",
